{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/program' data-target='computer\/program' data-title='Program'>\r\n\t\t\tProgram\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/program\/apache_httpd' data-target='computer\/program\/apache_httpd' data-title='Apache HTTPD'>\r\n\t\t\tApache HTTPD\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Working notes on .htAccess: Turn on rewrite engine, ForceType, DefaultType, ErrorDocument, Redirect 404 /, and Default file.","label":".htAccess","prevArticle":{"id":"computer\/program\/apache_httpd\/download","label":"Download","url":"\/computer\/program\/apache_httpd\/download"},"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/program\/apache_httpd\/https","label":"https","url":"\/computer\/program\/apache_httpd\/https"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<p>\n\t\tHttpd.conf.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tLoadModule rewrite_module modules\/mod_rewrite.so.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>&lt;Directory&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tOptions FollowSymLinks.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tAllowOverride None.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>&lt;\/Directory&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tRename .htaccess.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tAccessFileName [filename].\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t.htaccess.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Turn on rewrite engine<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tRewriteEngine On.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tRewriteBase \/.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>ForceType<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tApplication\/x-httpd-html.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>DefaultType<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tText\/html.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<ul class=\"list-bullet content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>Non Extension files.<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ul>\n\t<h2>ErrorDocument<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\t404.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>\/&lt;path from documentRoot&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>url &lt;http:\/\/_&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>url \"&lt;string&gt;\"<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\t(default).\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Redirect 404 \/<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tRedirects 404 errors to page.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Default file<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>Default file DirectoryIndex &lt;path&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>Variables<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>%{QUERY_STRING}<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>%{REQUEST_FILENAME}<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tPath of the file invoked to serve the request.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>%{DOCUMENT_ROOT}<\/code><\/pre>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/program\/apache_httpd\/htaccess\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/program\/apache_httpd\/htaccess\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/program\/apache_httpd\/download' data-target='computer\/program\/apache_httpd\/download' data-title='Download' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loa